  "question": {
    "text": "Two loudspeakers L<sub>1</sub> and L<sub>2</sub>, driven by a common oscillator and amplifier, are arranged as shown. The frequency of the oscillator is gradually increased from zero and the detector at D records a series of maxima and minima. If the speed of sound is 330 ms<sup>-1</sup>, then at what frequency (in Hz) does the first maximum is observed?<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0011667_Ques1_1.jpg\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "330",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let Δx = path difference<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>Δ</mtext> <mi>x</mi> <mo>=</mo> <msub> <mtext>L</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mtext>D</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mtext>L</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mtext>D</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>Δ</mtext> <mi>x</mi> <mo>=</mo> <msqrt> <msup> <mtext>40</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mn>9</mn> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </msqrt> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>40</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>Δ</mtext> <mi>x</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>41</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>40</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>Δ</mtext> <mi>x</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>m</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br />For first maximum, n = 1<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mi>Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mi>Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mfrac> <mi>V</mi> <mi>f</mi> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <mi>n</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow> <mi>x</mi> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>330 Hz</mn></mrow> </math>",
